<div class="hero">
<h1 class="page-title">Mugsy, taken apart</h1>
<p class="lede">An annotated disassembly of <em>Mugsy</em> (Melbourne House, 1984) for the ZX Spectrum: a comic-strip game of gangsters, protection money and a hit man, driven by a bytecode script. Every routine is titled and explained, every instruction commented.</p>
<ul class="stats">
<li><b>356</b><span>blocks titled and described</span></li>
<li><b>8,229</b><span>line comments</span></li>
<li><b>15</b><span>trivia entries</span></li>
<li><b>12</b><span>bugs in the original</span></li>
<li><b>84</b><span>script variables</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
