<a class="card" href="reference/bugs.html"><strong>Bugs</strong><span>12 faults in the original, each re-tested on the simulator or the script.</span></a>
<a class="card" href="reference/facts.html"><strong>Trivia</strong><span>15 odd facts about the program, checked against the code.</span></a>
