{ 10 | #R33592 | TotalKilled | Total number of hoods killed during the game }
{ 11 | #R33596 | Blunders | Number of blunders (silly answers) made this year }
{ 12 | #R33600 | TotalBlunders | Total number of blunders made during the game }
